          "items": [
            "The Lazy Dachsund | Luxury Inlet Beach Retreat Near 30A<br><br>Welcome to The Lazy Dachsund, an elegant coastal escape. Designed for elevated beach living, this beautifully appointed home offers upscale comfort, thoughtful design, and easy access to the best of 30A.<br><br>The Space<br>This 3-bedroom, 4-bathroom home comfortably sleeps up to 10 guests and features a bright, open floor plan filled with natural light and refined coastal style.<br>The second-floor main living area is the heart of the home, showcasing:<br>A chef-inspired kitchen with stainless steel appliances, gas stove, custom cabinetry, and large island<br>Spacious dining area ideal for gatherings<br>Cozy living room with fireplace<br>Private back deck with grill, perfect for enjoying Florida evenings<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements<br>Primary Suite (1st Floor): King bed, backyard access, spa-style bathroom with soaking tub, separate shower, dual vanities, and walk-in closet<br>Bedroom 2 (3rd Floor): Queen bed, private balcony, ensuite bathroom<br>Bedroom 3 (3rd Floor): Two twin bunk beds, adjacent hallway bathroom<br>Loft (3rd Floor): Queen sleeper sofa + additional lounge space<br><br>Maximum Occupancy: 10 guests (children under 2 count toward occupancy)<br><br>Location & Amenities<br>Beach Access: Inlet Beach Regional Access (parking, restrooms, lifeguards seasonally)<br>Community Pool: 3-minute walk<br>Camp Helen State Park & Lake Powell: ½ mile east for nature, hiking, and water activities<br>Snorkeling & Diving: Nearby artificial reef with abundant marine life<br>Parking: Garage + driveway<br>Airport: 20.7 miles to ECP (Panama City Beach)<br><br>Guest Experience<br>Professionally cleaned and sanitized<br>Keyless entry<br><br>House Rules (Strictly Enforced)<br>Primary renter must be 25+ years old and stay in the home<br>IDs may be requested<br>No smoking or vaping<br>No pets<br>No parties or events<br>No firearms<br>Quiet hours: 10 PM – 7 AM<br><br>Trash Pickup: Tuesdays & Fridays<br>Trash cans must be placed out the night before and returned to the garage after pickup to avoid fines.",
